-- Each expansion's profession skill can be learned from a trainer (Four, 2026-11-09). Run against
-- bfa_world.
--
-- No trainer taught the Outland, Northrend, Pandaria, Draenor or Legion skill of any profession, and only
-- some taught Cataclysm. Every trainer list that teaches a profession's Classic skill now also teaches
-- that profession's Outland to Legion skills (10 copper, needs the profession). Kul Tiran stays with the
-- Kul Tiras and Zandalar trainers. Fishing trainers already teach every expansion.
--
-- Also: the herbalism trainers in Honor Hold, Thrallmar, Shattrath, Blood Watch, Northrend, both Dalarans and
-- a few Classic towns pointed at trainer list 133, which doesn't exist, so they taught nothing. They now use
-- the herbalism list 424. Grix "Ironfists" Barlow pointed at the missing list 994; he now uses his own Kul
-- Tiran blacksmithing list 133536.
--
-- Re-runnable: deletes exactly the rows it inserts first.

UPDATE `creature_trainer` SET `TrainerId` = 424 WHERE `TrainerId` = 133;
UPDATE `creature_trainer` SET `TrainerId` = 133536 WHERE `CreatureId` = 133536 AND `TrainerId` = 994;

